<h2 id="warning-title" class="text-danger">⚠ DANGER: The Wilderness ⚠</h2>
<p><strong>Are you sure?</strong> The Wilderness contains unmoderated posts and potentially disturbing language. Turn back now if you want to keep things civilized.</p>
<div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
